1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,478
Pad kid poured curd

2
00:00:01,478 --> 00:00:02,622
pulled cod.

3
00:00:02,622 --> 00:00:03,300
Your turn.

4
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,860
Five times, fast.

5
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:05,760
Tangled?

6
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,110
Your mouth tried to say

7
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:09,067
TWO sounds at once.

8
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:09,990
Say it slow.

9
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,973
P pops at your LIPS...

10
00:00:12,973 --> 00:00:14,920
K, at the BACK.

11
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:15,701
Speed up,

12
00:00:15,701 --> 00:00:16,780
and your mouth slips into

13
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,056
an easier rhythm:

14
00:00:18,056 --> 00:00:20,133
it fires BOTH.

15
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:20,869
That's why the first

16
00:00:20,869 --> 00:00:21,828
one's easy...

17
00:00:21,828 --> 00:00:23,900
and the fifth falls apart.

18
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,194
MIT tried this one

19
00:00:25,194 --> 00:00:26,610
on volunteers.

20
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,980
Some just...

21
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,739
stopped talking.

22
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:30,910
Still talking?

23
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,267
Then go FASTER.

